5,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"I want to see how the systems actually hold up in the yards. I'll check the yard devices and the 2021 scheduling trial, plus the depot calendar and the peak-season cutover.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,I am concerned about the long-term costs. I will examine the board minutes on capital and operating requests and five years of renewal invoices.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I'll look into support ownership during last winter's outage and the warehouse rule changes after new accounts to see where our planning fails.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Rin,,I'm curious about things that get old or broken! I'll check the upgrade history of the dispatch tool and the data lift in the 2018 pay move.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,"I shall focus on our people. I will review administrator retirements and hiring times, as well as depot supervisors and the last rollout.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
